{"id": "34444", "title": "名牌美少女", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 67, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34444.htm", "intro": "好吧！她承认她真的很爱名牌，为了名牌她可以天天吃泡面！可是这也不能怪她啊～～ 毕竟如果一个人曾经被继母虐待得像个灰姑娘，被当菲佣一样的使唤、穿破旧的衣服、睡储藏室……长大好不容易可以自己赚钱脱离魔掌，会爱上名牌一点都不奇怪！但，她真的、真的很爱名牌，也立志要嫁给有钱人，为什么却轻易被这个铁板烧小厨师的菜给收服了呢？他只要按三餐替她做个饭，她就高兴得像是LV大特价，或是CELINE酬宾大赠送～～不行！她得理智一点，没有名牌她活不下去说，这个穷光蛋养不起她的啦！可是……虾米?!小厨师被绑架了！名牌、积蓄全交出去，她倾家荡产也要把他救回来……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34444", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2186278.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2186279.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186280.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186281.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186282.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186283.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186284.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186285.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186286.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186287.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186288.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186289.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186290.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186291.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186292.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186293.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186294.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186295.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186296.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186297.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186298.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186299.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186300.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2186301.html", "available